{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e334711c-6862-88f1-924a-8bb18dc7ea63",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T13:27:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:25:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Monday, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Yes, hello. My name is Carlos Fortes. I am calling about, um, parking tickets. I am on the speaker, I hope you can hear me okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loud and clear. What's going on with the tickets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I received two tickets, in the same place, on the same day. Same street, same car. One in the morning and one in the afternoon. This I do not think is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two in one day, same spot. Okay. Was there a snow restriction or anything posted down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, maybe, because of the storm. Last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. But I moved the car Sunday, [pause] como se diz, I did what I could. The snow was very much. Then Monday I find the two papers on the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that storm kept everybody guessing. So you'd like to contest them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I want to write a letter, an appeal. Where do I send it? To what address, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it to the City of Newport, attention parking violations, at City Hall. Put both ticket numbers in the letter and keep copies of everything. I can also give you the street address again if you want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, yes, one moment. [line breaks up] Sorry, can you say again? The speaker, it cuts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. City Hall, attention parking violations, Newport, Rhode Island. If you're mailing it, add the zip for Newport and you're set. Want me to slow down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I have it now. Thank you. And one more thing. If I must pay one of them, can I pay on Saturday or Sunday? I work in the week, and the office is closed, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall's closed weekends, yes. But there's an online payment option, and a drop box for payments outside regular hours. Online works any day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. [pause] Excuse me, I am a little distracted. My favorite mug just chipped, right now, on the counter. Is a small thing, but it is my favorite."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry to hear that. Those are always the good ones. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help, Mr. Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:27:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Fortes. Good luck with the appeal."
    }
  ],
